clavicular</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">scapulothoracic</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">glenohumeral</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">elbow</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">radioulnar</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">rc (WeldJoint)</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Какие координаты есть в модели? (список названий)</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">ground_thorax_rot_x</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">ground_thorax_rot_y</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">ground_thorax_rot_z</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">ground_thorax_tx</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">ground_thorax_ty</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">ground_thorax_tz</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">clav_prot</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">clav_elev</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">scapula_abduction</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">scapula_elevation</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">scapula_upward_rot</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">scapula_winging</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">shoulder_elv</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">plane_of_elev</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">axial_rot</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">elbow_flexion</span></p></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">pro_sup</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли тело clavicle_r и clavicle_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только одно тело </span><code>clavicle</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли тело scapula_r и scapula_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только одно тело </span><code>scapula</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли тело humerus_r и humerus_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только одно тело </span><code>humerus</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли тело ulna_r и ulna_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только одно тело </span><code>ulna</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли тело radius_r и radius_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только одно тело </span><code>radius</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли сустав sternoclavicular_r и sternoclavicular_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только один сустав </span><code>sternoclavicular</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли сустав acromioclavicular_r и acromioclavicular_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли сустав glenohumeral_r и glenohumeral_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только один сустав </span><code>glenohumeral</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли сустав humeroulnar_r и humeroulnar_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только один сустав </span><code>elbow</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">Есть ли сустав radioulnar_r и radioulnar_l?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Нет. Есть только один сустав </span><code>radioulnar</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">У сустава glenohumeral_r и glenohumeral_l какие есть координаты?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Суставы </span><code>_r</code><span class=\"\"> и </span><code>_l</code><span class=\"\"> отсутствуют. У сустава </span><code>glenohumeral</code><span class=\"\"> есть координаты: </span><code>shoulder_elv</code><span class=\"\">, </span><code>plane_of_elev</code><span class=\"\">, </span><code>axial_rot</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"\">У сустава humeroulnar_r и humeroulnar_l какие есть координаты?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\">Суставы </span><code>_r</code><span class=\"\"> и </span><code>_l</code><span class=\"\"> отсутствуют. У сустава </span><code>elbow</code><span class=\"\"> есть координата: </span><code>elbow_flexion</code><span class=\"\">.</span></p></li></ul></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"ds-theme\" style=\"--ds-rgb-hover: 245 245 245; --ds-rgb-primary: 77 107 254; --ds-input-prefix